---
id: "team"
---

## Core Intent

One List, three uses: the default PersonRow, PersonCard and PersonChip injected into its item slot.

## Visual Contract

<Page>
  <Instance
    name="list-1"
    component="List"
    x={160}
    y={152}
  />
  <Instance
    name="list-2"
    component="List"
    x={540}
    y={152}
  >
    <Slot name="item">
      <Instance
        name="personcard"
        component="PersonCard"
        props={{ item: '{item}' }}
        layoutAlign="STRETCH"
      />
    </Slot>
  </Instance>
  <Instance
    name="list-3"
    component="List"
    x={900}
    y={-2}
  >
    <Slot name="item">
      <Instance
        name="personchip"
        component="PersonChip"
        props={{ item: '{item}' }}
      />
    </Slot>
  </Instance>

</Page>
